=\"button\">添加</button></div></section><p class=\"vf-muted\">关键词和效果分类用于描述与展示；实际效果仍由技能代码决定。</p><section class=\"vf-section\" data-visual-field=\"statusTag\"><h3>技能状态标签</h3><button class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"button\">新增状态标签</button></section></div><div class=\"form-section grid2\"><div class=\"field-group\"><label>名称 <small>name</small></label><input data-field-path=\"name\" data-value-type=\"text\" type=\"text\" value=\"结构化语句编辑验收\"></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>描述 <small>description</small></label><textarea data-field-path=\"description\" rows=\"3\">由句子编辑器创建效果图</textarea></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>能力类型 <small>kind</small></label><select data-field-path=\"kind\" data-value-type=\"kind\"><option value=\"\">未设置</option><option value=\"active\" selected=\"\">主动能力</option><option value=\"passive\">被动能力</option></select><small class=\"field-help\">用于技能 Cluster 的主动 / 被动分类；未设置会保留原数据。</small></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>类型 <small>type</small></label><input data-field-path=\"type\" data-value-type=\"text\" type=\"text\" value=\"normal\"></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>冷却回合 <small>cooldownTurns</small></label><input data-field-path=\"cooldownTurns\" data-value-type=\"number\" type=\"number\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>行动点 <small>actionPointCost</small></label><input data-field-path=\"actionPointCost\" data-value-type=\"number\" type=\"number\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>范围 <small>range</small></label><input data-field-path=\"range\" data-value-type=\"text\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"field-group\"><label>需要目标 <small>requiresTarget</small></label><select data-field-path=\"requiresTarget\" data-value-type=\"boolean\"><option value=\"true\">是 / true</option><option value=\"false\">否 / false</option></select></div></div></section>\n    <section class=\"editor-pane\" data-editor-pane=\"graph\"><div data-gameplay-modules=\"\" class=\"gameplay-module-editor\" data-gameplay-module-editor=\"true\"><div class=\"gameplay-module-topbar\"><div class=\"gameplay-module-header\"><h2>玩法模块图 · skills/code</h2><p class=\"gameplay-module-help\">使用已登记模块、类型化参数和数据引用组合玩法；修复完成前的草稿仍可留在编辑器中。</p></div><div class=\"gameplay-module-toolbar\"><button class=\"gameplay-module-button primary\" type=\"button\">建立模块图</button><button class=\"gameplay-module-button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-gameplay-module-expand=\"true\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"展开模块编辑工作区\">展开工作区</button></div></div><section class=\"gameplay-module-empty-state\"><h3>这个内容还没有作者层模块图</h3><p>建立后可从模块目录加入调用、分支、逐项执行和返回语句。旧脚本字段不会在这里编辑。</p></section></div><div data-content-graph=\"\" class=\"content-graph-editor\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"content-graph-help\">内容流程图 · skills/code<span> 图只编辑结构化节点参数；生成的代码由可信编译器写入，编辑器不会执行 JavaScript。</span></p><div class=\"content-graph-toolbar\"><select aria-label=\"流程图入口\"><option value=\"code\">主入口 · code</option></select><select aria-label=\"新增节点类型\"><option value=\"bind\">绑定输入</option><option value=\"call\">调用能力</option><option value=\"branch\">条件分支</option><option value=\"set\">设置值</option><option value=\"loop\">循环子流程</option><option value=\"invoke\">调用子流程</option><option value=\"delete\">删除属性</option><option value=\"try\">异常处理子流程</option><option value=\"throw\">抛出异常</option><option value=\"materializeSource\">创建独立卡牌或续接子图</option><option value=\"return\">返回结果</option></select><button class=\"content-graph-button\" type=\"button\">新增节点</button><button class=\"content-graph-button\" type=\"button\">建立流程图</button></div><p class=\"content-graph-empty\">这个内容尚未建立流程图。建立后可以从绑定、调用、设置、分支和返回节点组合出受支持的结构。</p></div><div data-source-flow=\"\" class=\"source-flow\" hidden=\"\"><details><summary>运行入口与解析说明</summary><p class=\"flow-context\">技能主动入口：本棋子=context.piece。若被规则triggerSkill调用，实际接口和对象绑定不同，需按规则入口核查。</p><p class=\"flow-note\">源码流程是静态投影，不执行代码，也不代表所有逻辑已转换为纯参数节点。表达式内部短路/三元判断保留在节点源码中；函数和回调在独立子流程中展示。</p></details><div class=\"flow-links\"></div><div class=\"flow-toolbar\"><select